OL,3,GNEWSAThe Glasgow weavers helping the
OL,4,Afight to defend Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA quiet old school building in the east
OL,7,Fend of Glasgow may seem a world away
OL,8,Ffrom the war-torn streets of Ukraine's
OL,9,Fcities.
OL,11,FBut in a converted classroom, a group
OL,12,Fof refugees are putting their hearts
OL,13,Finto helping their homeland ` by
OL,14,Fweaving camouflage nets for the war
OL,15,Feffort.
OL,17,FEveryone in the Weegie Weavers team has
OL,18,Ffamily in Ukraine, including some
OL,19,Fserving in the military. Their own
OL,20,Flives remain "on pause" as the conflict
OL,21,Fcontinues.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
