OL,3,GNEWSAThe Glasgow weavers helping the
OL,4,Afight to defend Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor four years now many of the group
OL,7,Fhave met, talked, shared laughter, and
OL,8,Fexpressed their worries to each other.
